StatStoppedTime [SimTalk]
Returns the total time during which the LockoutZone designated by <Path> stopped the processing
operations of the assigned stations.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.StatStoppedTime → time
Watchable
The read-only attribute is watchable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type time.
Example
print MyLockoutZone.StatStoppedTime
See also
Tab Statistics [LockoutZone]
